From 88ccb45a6358b10f47bc989830e7ceb4ebd62324 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cheeseballDev <cheeseballbusinessemail@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:59:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] UPDATES - Mobile app overhaul: checklist bug fixes, new
 features, modern UI

Bug fixes
- Login follows requiresOtp / requiresPasswordChange; session saved only with a real token
- Global 401 handling: logs out and shows "session expired" on the login screen
- Mobile is limited to OWNER / MANAGER / STAFF (ADMIN and CASHIER are told to use the website)
- Receive delivery: picked expiry date (was hard-coded), received qty kept apart from requested,
  recycled-row TextWatcher bug, received <= requested, reason dropdown saved
- Request approve/reject only for the current approval stage (same rule as the website),
  reject needs remarks, confirmations, no double submit, checkbox recycle bug
- Delivery actions follow status and branch, with confirmations
- Batch list uses the tapped row's branch; Edit batch works
- Dashboard shows real KPIs (pendingApprovalsList typo fixed)
- Delivery filters: status no longer overwrites search, direction sent, query names match the website
- Request/Delivery paging wired; Inventory paging no longer duplicates; search debounced;
  lists refresh after actions
- Readable error messages, request message dialog, inventory @Path bugs
- Retrofit uses the app context, BASE_URL in BuildConfig, no cleartext, session not backed up,
  bottom nav in sync, fragment loaded once, FCM token deleted on logout

New
- Temporary password screen and OTP screen with resend timer
- Forgot password in 3 steps with the live password checklist
- Notifications list + unread badge + Firebase push service
- Low-stock badges, create transfer request

Design
- Colors, type and radius from the website (light and dark), Lucide icons, status badges

